 *
 * @section reference_runtime Runtime interfaces
 *
 * - proto_fuzzer::RunScenario selects and runs the scenario's runtime policy.
 * - proto_fuzzer::TransferSession owns the transfer resources and cleanup order.
 * - proto_fuzzer::ScenarioRequestData retains request and callback state.
 * - proto_fuzzer::MockServerBase provides the shared peer interface.
 * - proto_fuzzer::H2Runtime coordinates HTTP/2 protocol work across transports.
 *
 * Browse the class and file lists for the other protocol peers, normalization
 * helpers, and lifetime contracts. Source links connect each documented
 * interface to its implementation.
